OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir water levels higher than
OL,4,Ain 2022 drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FA utility company has said the water
OL,7,Flevels in the South West's reservoirs
OL,8,Fare "still in quite a healthy position"
OL,9,Fdespite consecutive heatwaves.
OL,11,FRalph Ledbetter, water services
OL,12,Fstrategic lead at South West Water,
OL,13,Fsaid natural levels across Devon and
OL,14,FCornwall were "in a much better
OL,15,Fposition" than they had been in the
OL,16,Fdrought four years ago.
OL,18,FHe said the water levels in the
OL,19,Freservoirs, external were about 15% to
OL,20,F20% per cent higher than they had been
OL,21,Fin August 2022.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
