OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir water levels higher than
OL,4,Ain 2022 drought
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Whilst we're around 56% full at the
OL,7,Fmoment, we know that there's going to
OL,8,Fbe a continued dry period during August
OL,9,Fand September so we're looking ahead
OL,10,Fand making sure that we're being
OL,11,Fproactive," he added.
